re than those who associate others with Allāh. One of them wishes that he could be granted life a thousand years, but it would not remove him in the least from the [coming] punishment that he should be granted life. And Allāh is Seeing of what they do.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":96,"sd":null},{"k":"2:97","t":"Say, \"Whoever is an enemy to Gabriel - it is [none but] he who has brought it [i.e., the Qur’ān] down upon your heart, [O Muḥammad], by permission of Allāh, confirming that which was before it and as guidance and good tidings for the believers.\"","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":97,"sd":null},{"k":"2:98","t":"Whoever is an enemy to Allāh and His angels and His messengers and Gabriel and Michael - then indeed, Allāh is an enemy to the disbelievers.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":98,"sd":null},{"k":"2:99","t":"And We have certainly revealed to you verses [which are] clear proofs, and no one would deny them except the defiantly disobedient.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"2:100","t":"Is it not [true] that every time they took a covenant a party of them threw it away? But, [in fact], most of them do not believe.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":100,"sd":null},{"k":"2:101","t":"And when a messenger from Allāh came to them confirming that which was with them, a party of those who had been given the Scripture threw the Scripture of Allāh [i.e., the Torah] behind their backs as if they did not know [what it contained].","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":101,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":2,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}